cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the NegPairs data, please cite them as below."
title: "Negation Scope in MaxSim-Family Scorers: code and data (NegPairs)"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kotan
    given-names: Kurban
    affiliation: Manisa Celal Bayar University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6660-0565"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kurbankotan/negation-scope-maxsim"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and provenance records for the article "Negation Scope in MaxSim-Family Scorers:
  Exact Limits, Permutation Minimal Pairs, and the Behavior of Released Systems": the NegPairs
  minimal-pair data sets (v1, Fresh and the permutation set Perm), the analysis package, the Colab
  notebooks of every run, the run outputs, the independent recomputation and the manuscript
  pipeline that rebuilds every reported number from the run outputs.
keywords:
  - negation
  - negation scope
  - late interaction
  - ColBERT
  - MaxSim
  - minimal pairs
  - information retrieval
  - evaluation
